{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig too deep, they said. <strong>What could possibly go wrong?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into our hollow earth \u2014 <strong>part platformer, part defense game</strong>, part bad idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a base, fend off uninvited guests, and uncover ancient secrets you were absolutely not meant to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go <strong>solo or team up for classic couch-co-op chaos</strong> \u2014 the kind where you and your friends yell \u201c<i>I told you not to press that button!</i>\u201d right before everything explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Base</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is scattered with mysterious red crystals \u2014 or, as we call them, \u201cconveniently pre-approved construction zones.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them to place buildings, turrets, or whatever contraption you think will stop the incoming horde. Choose wisely \u2014 build spots are limited, and enemy attack paths have been described by experts as \u201cunpredictable\u201d and \u201cmildly rude.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/57356c0220643296b7ce4b798fd8630e.poster.avif?t=1763417545\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/57356c0220643296b7ce4b798fd8630e.webm?t=1763417545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/57356c0220643296b7ce4b798fd8630e.mp4?t=1763417545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvest Resources</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns out, simply obliterating your enemies doesn\u2019t pay the bills. To gather resources, you\u2019ll need to roam the map in search of chests stuffed with random goodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also find blue crystals scattered about \u2014 harvest them for funds, upgrades, and the comforting illusion of economic stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/5c073d65922baec0b4b08d47c6993715.poster.avif?t=1763417545\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/5c073d65922baec0b4b08d47c6993715.webm?t=1763417545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/5c073d65922baec0b4b08d47c6993715.mp4?t=1763417545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your Base</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is more than a pile of turrets \u2014 it\u2019s your lifeline. Spend your hard-earned loot on new weapons, gadgets, and upgrades, then mix firepower with fortifications to hold the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the waves, protect your HQ, and try not to look too surprised when it actually works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/987cbcb6805e9f8ca94fda70b3b6c945.poster.avif?t=1763417545\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/987cbcb6805e9f8ca94fda70b3b6c945.webm?t=1763417545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/987cbcb6805e9f8ca94fda70b3b6c945.mp4?t=1763417545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Arrival Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3078330/cd508799acd4dcc8bbccf97f02f8c3f70fd58297.jpg"},{"name":"Siege Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3078330/ab2f173cec17a62672fd19164a084a26b3582120.jpg"},{"name":"Bastion Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3078330/8ef0dd73ce6abfe9b9b67d54001130a0c97dcac9.jpg"},{"name":"Phantom Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3078330/c90487f076f3c5b74a56249ec7145126c12acd33.jpg"},{"name":"Haven Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3078330/36e0a0d6d45ecfbd4f9d657ef283c86f21f47df2.jpg"},{"name":"Zenith Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3078330/1753de8048ea2f9c5a9b9a412e7f9c247ece859f.jpg"},{"name":"Rift Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3078330/e7d57dadf96cf73d60b5040a25ee3b306baba746.jpg"},{"name":"Havoc Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3078330/f40402b10db8662ee6feeddea7ae74578411cd0f.jpg"},{"name":"Nexus Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3078330/946b44dcdedb47e3f52de023ffd45a309a1bd78d.jpg"},{"name":"Mirage Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3078330/49d144a04627641811f0ee3ded9c890fff07a5da.jpg"}],"total":54},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3078330?t=1763417545","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763417545","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/7fd8e348a18d491ff889a9e8b242c4456068b001/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763417545","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/7fd8e348a18d491ff889a9e8b242c4456068b001/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763417545","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains violence, combat and warfare in a Science Fiction war setting. It includes blood, flame thrower violence and explosive damage."},"demos":[{"appid":3454330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig too deep, they said. <strong>What could possibly go wrong?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into our hollow earth \u2014 <strong>part platformer, part defense game</strong>, part bad idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a base, fend off uninvited guests, and uncover ancient secrets you were absolutely not meant to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go <strong>solo or team up for classic couch-co-op chaos</strong> \u2014 the kind where you and your friends yell \u201c<i>I told you not to press that button!</i>\u201d right before everything explodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Base</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is scattered with mysterious red crystals \u2014 or, as we call them, \u201cconveniently pre-approved construction zones.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them to place buildings, turrets, or whatever contraption you think will stop the incoming horde. Choose wisely \u2014 build spots are limited, and enemy attack paths have been described by experts as \u201cunpredictable\u201d and \u201cmildly rude.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/57356c0220643296b7ce4b798fd8630e.poster.avif?t=1763417545\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/57356c0220643296b7ce4b798fd8630e.webm?t=1763417545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/57356c0220643296b7ce4b798fd8630e.mp4?t=1763417545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harvest Resources</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turns out, simply obliterating your enemies doesn\u2019t pay the bills. To gather resources, you\u2019ll need to roam the map in search of chests stuffed with random goodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll also find blue crystals scattered about \u2014 harvest them for funds, upgrades, and the comforting illusion of economic stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/5c073d65922baec0b4b08d47c6993715.poster.avif?t=1763417545\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/5c073d65922baec0b4b08d47c6993715.webm?t=1763417545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/5c073d65922baec0b4b08d47c6993715.mp4?t=1763417545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your Base</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is more than a pile of turrets \u2014 it\u2019s your lifeline. Spend your hard-earned loot on new weapons, gadgets, and upgrades, then mix firepower with fortifications to hold the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the waves, protect your HQ, and try not to look too surprised when it actually works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/987cbcb6805e9f8ca94fda70b3b6c945.poster.avif?t=1763417545\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/987cbcb6805e9f8ca94fda70b3b6c945.webm?t=1763417545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/extras/987cbcb6805e9f8ca94fda70b3b6c945.mp4?t=1763417545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["9000 Legends"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078330/890a0908c6e3ce7bb4b8782610608d27649863f5/header.jpg?t=1763417545","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 \u2014 9000 Legends. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3078330/1222910767/730561d43ca243f2e4f17ddf8b653fe55b5a3524/1752668629/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752669999","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3078330/1222910767/730561d43ca243f2e4f17ddf8b653fe55b5a3524/1752668629/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752669999","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3078330/1222910767/730561d43ca243f2e4f17ddf8b653fe55b5a3524/1752668629/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752669999","id":25